The RapidYAML library in this directory is version 0.16.0, imported from:
https://github.com/biojppm/rapidyaml/archive/refs/tags/v0.16.0.tar.gz

It is an optional dependency of opentelemetry-cpp when it is built with
-DWITH_CONFIGURATION=ON.  It is required to implement WL#17297.

The imported source archive was preprocessed by running the following commands
from its top-level directory:

  rm -rf .github
  rm -rf api
  rm -rf bm
  rm -rf changelog
  rm -rf cmake
  rm -rf doc
  rm -rf img
  rm -rf proj
  rm -rf samples
  rm -rf src_extra
  rm -rf test
  rm -rf tools
  rm -f .clang-tidy .gitignore .gitmodules .lgtm.yml .readthedocs.yaml
  rm -f CMakeLists.txt CONTRIBUTING.md README.md ROADMAP.md compat.cmake tbump.toml
  rm -rf ext/c4core.dev
  rm -f ext/Makefile ext/README.md ext/c4core.cmake ext/c4core.dev.txt
  rm -f ext/c4core.mk ext/c4core.src.txt ext/c4core.yml ext/sync.py ext/testbm.cmake

The debugbreak and fast_float license notices were retained in:

  ext/c4core.src/c4/ext/debugbreak/debugbreak.h
  ext/c4core.src/c4/ext/fast_float_all.h

debugbreak.h is retained because c4core's error interface includes it.
